<body>
    <h1>Shutdown Settings in IGEL OS 12</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>
<style>[data-colorid=3Drii51io45y]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=3Dda=
rk] [data-colorid=3Drii51io45y]{color:#cccccc}[data-colorid=3Dydmfiz5d9g]{c=
olor:#333333} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dydmfiz5d9g]{colo=
r:#cccccc}[data-colorid=3Dlttdnighck]{color:#333333} html[data-color-mode=
=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dlttdnighck]{color:#cccccc}</style>This article sho=
ws the options to configure the behavior of shutdown menu in IGEL OS. The s=
hutdown menu button can be displayed in the start menu and in the Applicati=
on Launcher. For more information, see <a href=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassi=
an.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302390/Start+Menu+in+IGEL+OS+12" =
data-linked-resource-id=3D"73302390" data-linked-resource-version=3D"8" dat=
a-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Start Menu in IGEL OS 12</a> . You can also=
 configure the shutdown menu as a command session and configure various sta=
rting methods. For more information, see <a href=3D"https://igel-jira.atlas=
sian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302824/Commands+Session+in+IGEL=
+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73302824" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"8" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Commands Session in IGEL OS 12</a=
> .</p>
<hr>
<p>Menu path:<strong>&nbsp;System &gt; Power Options &gt; Shutdown</strong>=
</p>
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image con=
fluence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"c037e07e2b03958b392129cdbb67e7d88a253410771b3423d17e89ba073fb441" data-=
image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/7330=
2742/OS12.2_Power%20Options_Shutdown.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1716364682853&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"814" dat=
a-width=3D"973" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"73309339" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=
=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"OS12.2_Power Options_=
Shutdown.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-l=
inked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=
=3D"73302742" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" data-media-id=3D=
"5a28f63a-34af-4215-8a3e-fe8cfb950408" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"3=
91"></span>
<p></p>
<p>By default, when the user clicks the shutdown button, an information dia=
log is displayed. The user can select from the enabled actions or cancel th=
e procedure by closing the window by clicking X or by pressing [Esc].</p><s=
pan class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence=
-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-c=
ontent-image-border image-left" width=3D"400" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"9669c=
8b149241fe3033d63b552334a163d093b9e685ea4071100e2970ea5b67b" data-image-src=
=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302742/OS12=
.2_Power%20Options_Shutdown_Infodialog.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=
=3D1716364682844&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"234" dat=
a-width=3D"567" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"73308940" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=
=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"OS12.2_Power Options_=
Shutdown_Infodialog.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/w=
iki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-c=
ontainer-id=3D"73302742" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"4" data-=
media-id=3D"8ee31d78-ea3f-4197-b97d-84d91f768ea1" data-media-type=3D"file" =
height=3D"165"></span>
<h2 id=3D"ShutdownSettingsinIGELOS12-GlobalOptions">Global Options</h2>
<p><strong>Allow system shutdown</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91&nbsp;The user can shut down the device. The <strong>Shutdown</=
strong> button is shown in the info dialog. (Default)</p>
<p>=E2=98=90 The user cannot shut down the device. The <strong>Shutdown</st=
rong> button is not shown in the info dialog.&nbsp;</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Allow system suspend</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The user can suspend the device. The <strong>Suspend</strong> =
button is shown in the info dialog. (Default)</p>
<p>=E2=98=90 The user cannot suspend the device. The <strong>Suspend</stron=
g> button is not shown in the info dialog.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Allow system reboot</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The user can reboot the device. The <strong>Reboot</strong> bu=
tton is shown in the info dialog. (Default)</p>
<p>=E2=98=90 The user cannot reboot the device. The <strong>Reboot</strong>=
 button is not shown in the info dialog.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Allow system logoff</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The user can log off the device, if the user is logged in. The=
 <strong>Logoff</strong> button is shown in the info dialog. (Default)</p>
<p>=E2=98=90 The user cannot log off the device. The <strong>Logoff</strong=
>&nbsp;button is not shown in the info dialog.</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>To configure the option, at least one login method needs to be enabled u=
nder <strong>Security &gt; Logon</strong>. For more information, see <a hre=
f=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73308=
605/Logon+Settings+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73308605" data=
-linked-resource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Logon Set=
tings in IGEL OS 12</a> .</p>
</div>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Default action</strong></p>
<p>The action that is carried out if the timeout defined under&nbsp;<strong=
>Dialog timeout </strong>expires.<br>
Possible options:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Shutdown</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Suspend&nbsp;</strong>(Default)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Reboot</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Logoff</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Cancel</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Dialog timeout</strong></p>
<p>Time (in seconds) after which the info dialog will close and the action =
specified under&nbsp;<strong>Default action</strong>&nbsp;will be carried o=
ut. If the value is set to 0, the dialog will be shown until the user selec=
ts one of the possible actions. (Default:&nbsp;10)</p>
<h2 id=3D"ShutdownSettingsinIGELOS12-AdditionalParametersWhenTriggeredviaUM=
S"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"3b1e2889-ad43-41b1-8e0=
7-7c51a99e2675">Additional Parameters When Triggered via UMS</span><br></h2=
>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<h3 id=3D"ShutdownSettingsinIGELOS12-KnownIssue">Known Issue</h3>
<p><span data-colorid=3D"rii51io45y">For OS version 12.2.0, the parameters =
of the </span><strong><span data-colorid=3D"lttdnighck">Additional Paramete=
rs When Triggered via UMS</span></strong><span data-colorid=3D"ydmfiz5d9g">=
 are not effective. T</span>he parameters will be reworked in a future rele=
ase.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Allow canceling of shutdown process</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91&nbsp;The user can cancel the shutdown procedures initiated fro=
m the UMS by clicking the&nbsp;<strong>Cancel</strong>&nbsp;button in the i=
nfo dialog. (Default)</p>
<p>=E2=98=90&nbsp;The user cannot cancel the procedures.&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>For the manual cancellation to work, the following parameters need to be=
 configured:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Without dialog </strong>needs to be disabled.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Prompt user on UMS actions</strong> under <strong>System &gt; Re=
mote Management </strong>needs to be enabled. For details, see <a href=3D"h=
ttps://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IGELOS12BSDOCE/pages/73302629/Re=
mote+Management+in+IGEL+OS+12" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73302629" data-li=
nked-resource-version=3D"16" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Remote Mana=
gement in IGEL OS 12</a> .</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Without dialog</strong></p>
<p>=E2=98=91 The info dialog is not shown. The shutdown procedures initiate=
d from the UMS are carried out without notification.</p>
<p>=E2=98=90 The info dialog is shown. (Default)</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
